1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,707
Why won't this egg stay stopped?

2
00:00:03,007 --> 00:00:04,365
It's not a sloppy stop.

3
00:00:04,365 --> 00:00:07,199
A boiled egg, stopped the same way, stays still.

4
00:00:07,699 --> 00:00:08,367
Look inside.

5
00:00:08,367 --> 00:00:10,316
Your finger only stopped the shell.

6
00:00:10,816 --> 00:00:15,509
The runny inside keeps swirling, and when you let go, it drags the shell back around.

7
00:00:16,009 --> 00:00:18,789
A boiled egg is solid, so it all stops at once.

8
00:00:19,289 --> 00:00:19,794
Raw?
